00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:04.979
So, for Dieter's return in Planet of the Dead,
Snyder has said that "the real adventure would

00:06:04.979 --> 00:06:08.000
be to see what happened to him when that safe
door closed.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.110
We don't see him die on camera, and there's
still some time left."

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:15.849
A plausible way that Dieter could have survived
is if Zeus decided to keep him captive in

00:06:15.849 --> 00:06:19.229
the Olympus like he did with Geeta rather
than bite or kill him.

00:06:19.229 --> 00:06:22.729
Dieter already knew about the imminent nuclear
strike on the city.

00:06:22.729 --> 00:06:25.620
And Snyder has said that "there's still some
time left."

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:29.669
So let's say he escaped Zeus' capture and
got through the wall surrounding Vegas the

00:06:29.669 --> 00:06:30.669
way he came in.

00:06:30.669 --> 00:06:34.210
Once he was back at the quarantine camp, he
could have grabbed an abandoned vehicle and

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.529
got far enough away for safety before the
bomb landed.

00:06:37.529 --> 00:06:42.280
An alternate way for Dieter to survive would
be for a new loop or timeline to begin after

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.419
the Götterdämmerung closes.

00:06:43.419 --> 00:06:47.860
Because, remember, as Dieter says in Army
of Thieves, once all the locks are solved

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:50.770
in order, he believes that 'the cycle begins
anew'.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:55.110
Snyder has also said that in the sequel Dieter's
"brush with death would cause him to want

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.650
to find a jailed Gwendoline."

00:06:56.650 --> 00:07:01.550
And the ending of Army of Thieves sets this
up because although both Dieter and Gwen are

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:04.969
caught by Interpol, he's allowed to leave
while she's arrested.

00:07:04.969 --> 00:07:09.550
But as he escapes, Dieter thinks to himself
about how he and Gwen will eventually end

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:10.550
up together.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.509
We would one day be reunited in the vault
of the Götterdämmerung.

00:07:13.509 --> 00:07:18.330
Dieter's love for Gwen also explains why the
locksmith company where Scott and Cruz recruit

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.650
him is called Gwendoline Safe and Lock Co.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:25.020
Another detail about Planet of the Dead is
that in the official press notes for Army

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:30.050
of Thieves, Snyder has basically confirmed
that the zombie outbreak will go international.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:34.539
He says "as you go into the next cycle of
films or stories, it has an even larger global

00:07:34.539 --> 00:07:35.539
reach."

00:07:35.539 --> 00:07:39.419
I think it's intriguing that he uses the word
'cycle' here given everything we've already

00:07:39.419 --> 00:07:42.089
discussed about time loops and cycles.

00:07:42.089 --> 00:07:46.300
By the way, Snyder said that because Vanderohe
is touching down in Mexico City at the end

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:50.349
of the movie, if a zombie outbreak occurs,
it would be impossible to build a wall around

00:07:50.349 --> 00:07:55.129
the Mexican capital, as they do in Vegas,
so the virus would inevitably escape.

00:07:55.129 --> 00:08:00.569
Dieter's dreams in Army of Thieves also offer
up some fascinating foreshadowing and predictions

00:08:00.569 --> 00:08:03.020
of future events in the Army of the Dead franchise.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:08.189
For instance, after watching a news reporter
being attacked by zombies in Vegas, he drifts

00:08:08.189 --> 00:08:11.940
off and has visions of zombies attacking him
in the corridor of his apartment building,

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:16.119
a premonition of the zombies that will descend
on him in the basement of Tanaka's casino

00:08:16.119 --> 00:08:17.119
in Vegas.

00:08:17.119 --> 00:08:21.620
Dieter also has another zombie nightmare of
a horde of shamblers shuffling towards him

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:25.080
as he tries to crack the third Wagner safe,
the Siegfried.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:28.569
Although the setting is different, the look
of the corridor where the zombies approach

00:08:28.569 --> 00:08:32.940
is very reminiscent of the one leading to
the Götterdämmerung in Army of the Dead.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:37.329
And this time Dieter locks himself in the
safe to protect himself, like he did to Vanderohe

00:08:37.329 --> 00:08:38.699
in the original film.

00:08:38.699 --> 00:08:43.009
Perhaps this is how Dieter got the idea to
protect his buddy later on.

00:08:43.009 --> 00:08:47.960
And intriguingly, in Dieter's dream, a zombie
hand from inside the safe reaches up to grab

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:51.990
him, foreshadowing how Zeus will grasp him
from behind in the future.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:56.339
And when Korina comments about Dieter's recurring
visions, she alludes to his apparent death

00:08:56.339 --> 00:08:59.110
in Army of the Dead:
Maybe they're prophecies, not dreams.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:01.130
Maybe you saw your own death.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:05.139
And her comment on the repeating nature of
the nightmares could be another hint to the

00:09:05.139 --> 00:09:10.160
franchise's endless loops and cycles
You should be that big, tough man.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.550
And yet again and again, they just destroy
you.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:18.420
Dieter's dreams of zombies could also imply
he's having these visions because he already

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:21.110
encountered zombies in a previous time loop.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:25.360
If Dieter has already been through the mission
many times before, it could explain how he

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:30.540
can hit a target with a gun on his first try,
even though he's supposedly never used one

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.540
before.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:35.930
Like Army of the Dead, Army of Thieves keeps
it meta by playing around with and deconstructing

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:36.930
heist movie tropes.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.990
You know how sometimes in a heist movie, they
show a flash-forward of how the heist should

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:41.990
work?

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:42.990
And it never goes according to plan.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.000
Yes, I do know this.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:48.270
Which feels like a reference to the Army of
the Dead meeting with Tanaka where Dieter's

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:52.060
montage imagines how gloriously the heist
will go in Vegas, with everyone making it

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:56.290
down to the Götterdämmerung and safely making
it to the helicopter with all the money.

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:00.910
A possible additional interpretation is that
these montages are events that took place

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.029
in another timeline or time loop.

00:10:03.029 --> 00:10:08.470
I'm in two minds about this, but it is interesting
how the Paris heist ends with Dieter apparently

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:12.160
breaking out of the heist he sees in his mind
to discover it's already happened.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:13.160
And that's that?

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.160
That's that.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.079
It cannot be that easy.

00:10:16.079 --> 00:10:17.810
Sebastian, it's already done.

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:22.430
The prequel also reveals some interesting
background about the origin of Dieter's name.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:27.250
In reality, he's actually called Sebastian
and Ludwig Dieter is the name of a master

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.279
safecracker in a comic book he wrote when
he was a child.

00:10:29.279 --> 00:10:32.360
I thought it was, like, the coolest name ever.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:36.639
He takes on the Ludwig Dieter alias after
he finds Gwen used that name for the fake

00:10:36.639 --> 00:10:38.089
passport she made him.

00:10:38.089 --> 00:10:42.339
And apparently there's another layer of meaning
to it because the name "Ludwig" in German

00:10:42.339 --> 00:10:46.940
means "famous fighter or warrior" and "Dieter"
means "army of the people" or "warrior of

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:47.940
the people".

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:51.779
All of which could well point to Dieter's
importance in the future of the Army of the

00:10:51.779 --> 00:10:53.259
Dead franchise.

